        <![CDATA[<h2 id="under-the-task" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#under-the-task" class="header-mark"></a>Under the task</h2><ul>
<li>Write an essay,</li>
<li>must more than 250 word</li>
<li>40 minutes</li>
<li>Universal topics, anything</li>
<li>4 question types</li>
<li>score criteris
<ul>
<li>task response</li>
<li>cohenrence and cohesion</li>
<li>Vocabulary</li>
<li>Grammar (improve slowly, so improve other aspects)</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="break-the-task-into-parts" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#break-the-task-into-parts" class="header-mark"></a>Break the task into parts</h2><ul>
<li>4 paragraphs</li>
<li>about 13 sentence</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="intro" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#intro" class="header-mark"></a>Intro</h3><ul>
<li>2 sentences, more won&rsquo;t improve your score</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="two-main-paragraphs" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#two-main-paragraphs" class="header-mark"></a>Two main paragraphs</h3><ul>
<li>5 sentences each</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="conclusion" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#conclusion" class="header-mark"></a>Conclusion</h3><ul>
<li>1 sentence</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="method-for-different-parts" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#method-for-different-parts" class="header-mark"></a>Method for different parts</h2><h3 id="40-minutes" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#40-minutes" class="header-mark"></a>40 minutes</h3><ul>
<li>Intro, 5 minutes</li>
<li>Main body, 20 minutes</li>
<li>Conslusion: 5 minutes</li>
<li><code>planning</code>: 10 minutes</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="intro" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#intro" class="header-mark"></a>Intro</h3><p>2 sentences,</p>]]></description>
